{
 "encounter_id": "00581",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, I've been feeling so dizzy since the new tablet, and I'm honestly a bit scared."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay, let's work through it. Which new tablet is that?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The blood pressure one. Amlodipine, 5 mg, in the morning. You started it two weeks ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. And when does the dizziness hit?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When I stand up quick. The room kind of tilts, and I've got to grab the bench."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long does it last?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ten seconds or so. Then it passes. But what if I fall? I drive a taxi, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I understand. Anything else that's changed since the tablet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Headaches. Mild ones, behind my eyes, mostly in the afternoon."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tired. I'm flat out by three o'clock, and I used to be fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Has your heart been doing anything odd? Racing, skipping?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sometimes it's racing, like it's thumping, when I get the dizzy spell."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any blurred vision with the spells?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit blurry, yes, just for a second or two."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you actually fainted or passed out?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I've never passed out. Got close once at the servo but I held on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any numbness or weakness down one side, or trouble speaking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that. Just the dizziness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain with this?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain. I'd have called an ambulance."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any trouble with your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Breathing's fine. Same as always."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your stomach and bowels? Anything off there?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All normal, thanks. Nothing there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's go through your tablets. Amlodipine, and what else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Atorvastatin, 40 mg at night. And the water tablet, um, maybe 20 mg? I'd have to check the box."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's the frusemide you take with breakfast?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, that's the one. I just call it the water tablet. The dose, I'm not sure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll check the box before you go. And have you ever had any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin, when I was a kid. I came out in a rash. Mum said never again, so I've avoided it since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Penicillin, with a rash. I'll put that on your record."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What other conditions are you managing? Apart from your blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure for about five years. And high cholesterol. And a bit of reflux, which flares up at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A hernia repair, in 2019."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any heart trouble or strokes in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dad had a heart attack at fifty-eight. And Mum had a stroke in her seventies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, that's important. Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never smoked. Never really liked it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A couple of beers on the weekend. Nothing silly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You said you drive a taxi. Full-time?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yep, nights mostly. Twelve hours. I live with my wife, she's the one who nags me to come in."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you over. Stay seated while I take your pressure.",
   "pause": 4
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sitting, your blood pressure is 128 over 76. Now stand up for me, slowly.",
   "pause": 5
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Standing, it drops to 112 over 70. How do you feel?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit swimmy, but I'm all right."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse is 82, temperature 36.6 degrees, and oxygen is 97 percent."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A modest drop. Let me listen to your chest.",
   "pause": 6
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart sounds are normal, and your chest is clear on both sides."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can see mild swelling around both ankles, though. Your calves are soft, with no tenderness.",
   "pause": 3
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The ankles, yeah. I noticed my socks leave marks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That fits. Amlodipine can cause ankle swelling and a drop in pressure when you stand."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So it's the tablet? Should I stop it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "From what you've told me and what I found, it looks like a side effect of the amlodipine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it dangerous? Could I have a heart problem on top of it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I don't think so, but because your dad had a heart attack, I'd like to arrange an ECG today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Now?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The nurse can do it before you leave. I'd also like to order blood tests, for your kidneys and your salts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Because of the water tablet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exactly. Water tablets can upset the salts, which can also cause dizziness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So do I keep taking everything meanwhile?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, for now. Stand up slowly, sit on the edge of the bed first, and drink water through the day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And driving? I can't afford to stop."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Don't drive if you feel a spell coming. Pull over until it passes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. What if it doesn't go away?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the dizziness doesn't settle in two weeks, come back and see me, and we'll change the tablet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Righto. Thanks, doctor. You've settled my nerves a bit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Check that water tablet box on your way out, and tell the nurse the dose."
  }
 ],
